    <item>
      <title>The urban environment as a determinant of health</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s44284-026-00538-5</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Cities, Published online: 15 October 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s44284-026-00538-5"&gt;doi:10.1038/s44284-026-00538-5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Cities are powerful influences on health. Across this issue, researchers show how the environments people live in, move through and experience influence health outcomes, with risks and benefits distributed unevenly across urban populations.</content:encoded>
